    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The damming of the Catawba River to create Lake Norman was as influential to Cornelius’s development as the cotton industry once was.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.cornelius.org/visitors/town_history.php"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Potts Plantation, established in 1753, sits on the National Register of Historic Places and marks the area’s earliest European settlement.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7,
        17
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cornelius%2C_North_Carolina"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Cornelius proudly hosts a branch of the Public Library of Charlotte and Mecklenburg County, offering residents a regional research hub.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13
