      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cornelius%2C_North_Carolina"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Nestled along Lake Norman, the town lies roughly 20 miles north of Charlotte, giving it a scenic lakeside suburban feel.",
